WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.140
Welcome to Ledgerly. Sign in with Google or email to open your private workspace.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:15.612
Your workspace starts with sample purchase orders. Use synthetic invoices for this demo.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:25.636
Open the sample walkthrough and choose Approve a valid invoice. Use sample selects the PDF without uploading it.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:33.156
Check the filename, then start the workflow. Scanned documents may take longer.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:41.012
Ready for approval means the checks passed. A person still needs to review the invoice.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:49.428
Inspect the vendor, duplicate and purchase order checks. Expand a rule to see its reasoning.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:56.068
Compare the extracted values and source excerpts with the original PDF.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:05.268
Add a meaningful review note with at least five characters. Then approve after checking the evidence.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:12.412
If checks remain unresolved, request information or reject the invoice instead.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:23.156
Open Purchase orders. Approving sixty thousand rupees leaves forty thousand on this sample order. No payment is sent.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:33.316
Now try the duplicate, overage, missing information and scanned samples. Your workspace history affects the results.
